<li>Dance studios with sprung floors, barres and floor-to-ceiling mirrors.</li>
<li>Soundproofed music studios,</li>
<li>Black box theatre,</li>
<li>Recital hall,</li>
<li>Set construction workshop,</li>
<li>Meeting rooms.</li>
</ul>
